id: kickgoing
name: "KICKGOING"
when: "2021.06 – 2023.10"
role:
  en: "App Developer → Mobile Tech Lead"
  ko: "앱 개발팀 / 앱 개발자 → 연구개발본부 / Mobile Tech Lead"
desc:
  en: "Micro-mobility startup · ₩12B ARR · Mobile Tech Lead"
  ko: "마이크로 모빌리티 스타트업 · 연매출 120억 · Mobile Tech Lead"
story:
  en: "RN migration and in-app navigation. Founded monthly dev conference. Contributed to open-source."
  ko: "RN 마이그레이션·길안내. 월간 개발자 컨퍼런스 창설. 오픈소스 기여."
cur: false
projects[10]:
  - id: kickgoing-pass
    name: "킥고잉 패스"
    nameEn: "Kickgoing Pass"
    meta: "2021.09 – 2021.11 · Mobile · React Native"
    tags[2]: platform:ios,platform:android
    desc:
      en: "Subscription-style pass feature — users pay by time or rides based on usage pattern. Includes custom top-tab navigation, real-time countdown, deep link entry to Pass home, and a fully typed API service layer."
      ko: "이용 패턴에 맞춘 시간/횟수 정기권 기능. 커스텀 상단 탭, 실시간 카운트다운, 패스 홈 딥링크 진입, 타입 완비 API 서비스 레이어 포함."
    role:
      en: "Solo — the full Pass feature."
      ko: "단독 — 패스 기능 전체."
    work:
      en[2]:
        - "Designed typed API response models per endpoint with shared base types to cut duplication."
        - "Built custom top-tab navigation by styling React Navigation."
      ko[2]:
        - "엔드포인트별 API 응답 타입 모델을 공통 베이스 타입으로 설계해 중복 최소화."
        - "React Navigation 스타일링으로 커스텀 상단 탭 구현."
    achievement:
      en[3]:
        - "Drove a second-by-second pass countdown outside the render cycle by holding a Redux dispatch reference outside the component tree and firing a setInterval from it — no hidden container component needed."
        - "Added a deep link that jumps straight to the Pass home, working around a React Navigation limitation that blocked the built-in handler."
        - "Published two Medium articles on the Jest testing patterns developed alongside this feature."
      ko[3]:
        - "Redux dispatch 참조를 컴포넌트 트리 외부에 저장하고 setInterval에서 직접 호출해 렌더 사이클 밖에서 초 단위 카운트다운을 구현 — 숨겨진 컨테이너 불필요."
        - "React Navigation의 구조적 제한을 우회해 패스 홈으로 바로 진입하는 딥링크 구현."
        - "관련 Jest 테스트 패턴을 Medium 아티클 2편으로 게재."
    highlight:
      en: "Real-time countdown via Redux dispatch ref — bypassed React Navigation deep link limit"
      ko: "Redux dispatch 외부 참조로 실시간 카운트다운 — 딥링크 구조 한계 우회"
    tech[3]: TypeScript,"React Navigation","React Native"
    image: "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-pass1.png"
    images[6]:
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-pass1.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-pass2.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-pass3.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-pass4.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-pass5.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-pass6.png"
    links[2]:
      - label: "Medium: Jest Complex Test Case Part 1"
        href: "https://medium.com/@toyboy2/jest-complex-test-case-part1-3a165afdbbe9"
      - label: "Medium: Jest Complex Test Case Part 2"
        href: "https://medium.com/@toyboy2/jest-complex-test-case-part2-c12f57e5b2a8"
    diagrams[1]:
      - "flowchart TD\n  Marketing[\"Marketing Site\"]\n\n  subgraph App\n    subgraph PassScreen[\"Pass Screen\"]\n      subgraph MarketingTab[\"Marketing Tab\"]\n        Webview\n      end\n      PassListTab[\"Pass List Tab\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Timer\n      DispatchRef[\"Dispatch Ref\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph Redux\n      Store[\"Pass State\"]\n      Dispatch\n    end\n  end\n\n  subgraph Server\n    PassAPI[\"Pass API\"]\n  end\n\n  Marketing -->|Deeplink| PassListTab\n  Webview -->|Deeplink| PassListTab\n  Store --> PassListTab\n  PassAPI -->|fetch| PassListTab\n  Dispatch --> DispatchRef\n  DispatchRef -->|Update| Store"
  - id: kickgoing-auto-deploy
    name: "배포 및 테스트 자동화"
    nameEn: "CI/CD & Test Automation"
    meta: "2021.07 – 2021.09 · CI/CD · React Native"
    tags[3]: platform:ios,platform:android,lang:yaml
    desc:
      en: "CI/CD infrastructure for the KICKGOING React Native app — QA build separation (iOS multi-scheme, Android Flavor), GitHub Actions config injection, Fastlane deployment automation, and Husky commit hooks."
      ko: "KICKGOING React Native 앱 CI/CD 인프라 구축 — QA 빌드 분리(iOS 멀티 스킴, Android Flavor), GitHub Actions 설정 주입, Fastlane 배포 자동화, Husky 커밋 훅."
    role:
      en: "Solo — researched, implemented, and documented the full pipeline."
      ko: "단독 — 전체 파이프라인 리서치·구현·문서화."
    work:
      en[3]:
        - "Separated QA builds on both platforms — iOS multi-scheme, and Android Gradle Product Flavors with dedicated resources (researched from scratch)."
        - "Injected the correct config at deploy time via a GitHub Actions workflow, replacing manual dev/prod switching."
        - "Added Husky hooks (auto issue-number in commits, Jest pre-push gate) and tuned Jest CLI flags."
      ko[3]:
        - "양 플랫폼 QA 빌드 분리 — iOS 멀티 스킴, Android는 선례 없이 연구한 Gradle Product Flavor + 전용 리소스."
        - "GitHub Actions 워크플로우로 배포 시 올바른 설정 파일을 자동 주입해 수동 dev/prod 전환을 대체."
        - "Husky 훅(커밋 이슈번호 자동 추가, Jest 사전 푸시 게이트) 적용과 Jest CLI 튜닝."
    achievement:
      en[2]:
        - "Eliminated the risk of shipping a dev config and cut broken-build incidents, while letting testers keep the old and new QA builds side by side."
        - "Published two Medium articles documenting the techniques."
      ko[2]:
        - "잘못된 설정 배포 위험을 제거하고 빌드 오류를 줄였으며, 테스터가 이전·신규 QA 빌드를 동시에 설치할 수 있게 함."
        - "관련 기법을 Medium 아티클 2편으로 게재."
    highlight:
      en: "CI/CD pipeline — config injection eliminated wrong-env deploys"
      ko: "CI/CD 파이프라인 — 설정 주입으로 잘못된 환경 배포 위험 제거"
    tech[7]: Fastlane,"GitHub Actions",Jest,Husky,Gradle,TypeScript,YAML
    image: "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-deploy1.webp"
    images[3]:
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-deploy1.webp"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-deploy2.webp"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-deploy3.webp"
    links[2]:
      - label: "Medium: Android QA App Split"
        href: "https://medium.com/@toyboy2/how-to-split-android-project-for-qa-version-1128b2bce7bb"
      - label: "Medium: RN Deploy All-in-One"
        href: "https://medium.com/@toyboy2/how-to-deploy-react-native-app-all-in-one-click-part1-54362deaeda2"
    diagrams[1]:
      - "flowchart TD\n  Dev[\"Developer\"]\n\n  subgraph Git\n    Commit\n    Push\n  end\n\n  subgraph Husky[\"Husky (Git Hook)\"]\n    PreCommit[\"pre-commit - Attach Issue Number\"]\n    PrePush[\"pre-push\"]\n    LTest[\"Test (Jest)\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Github\n    PR[\"Pull Request\"]\n\n    subgraph Actions[\"GitHub Actions\"]\n      Test[\"Test (Jest)\"]\n      Trigger[\"Deploy\"]\n      IsQA{\"Is QA?\"}\n      ConfigInject[\"Config Injection\\n(URL / Amplitude)\"]\n      Uploader\n    end\n  end\n\n  subgraph Project[\"App Project\"]\n    Fastlane\n\n    subgraph Android\n      Gradle\n      Flavor\n    end\n\n    subgraph iOS\n      Scheme\n      Target\n    end\n\n    KICKGOING\n    TESTKICK\n  end\n\n  Slack\n\n  Dev --> Commit\n  Commit --> PreCommit\n  PreCommit --> Git\n\n  Dev --> Push\n  Push --> PrePush\n  PrePush --> LTest\n  LTest --> Github\n\n  Dev --> PR\n  PR --> Test\n\n  Dev --> Trigger\n  Trigger --> ConfigInject\n  ConfigInject --> IsQA\n  IsQA --> Fastlane\n\n  Fastlane --> iOS\n  Scheme --> Target\n  Target --> KICKGOING\n  Target -->|QA| TESTKICK\n\n  Fastlane --> Android\n  Gradle --> Flavor\n  Flavor --> KICKGOING\n  Flavor -->|QA| TESTKICK\n\n  Project --> Uploader\n  Uploader --> Slack"
  - id: kickgoing-city-pass
    name: "부천 스마트 시티패스 연동"
    nameEn: "Bucheon Smart City Pass Integration"
    meta: "2021.06 – 2021.07 · Mobile · React Native"
    tags[3]: platform:ios,platform:android,lang:reactnative
    desc:
      en: "Integration with Bucheon Smart City Pass — users can log into KICKGOING using their City Pass account. On Android, Install Referrer auto-connects the account even when the app wasn't installed at the time the partner link was tapped."
      ko: "부천 스마트 시티패스 계정으로 킥고잉 로그인 연동. Android는 Install Referrer로 링크 탭 시점에 앱이 없어도 설치 후 자동 연결."
    role:
      en: "Solo — first task assigned the day after joining."
      ko: "단독 — 입사 다음 날 맡은 첫 업무."
    work:
      en: "Implemented Android Install Referrer (react-native-play-install-referrer) to auto-connect a City Pass account after install, and handled the iOS deep link via React Native Linking."
      ko: "react-native-play-install-referrer로 Android Install Referrer를 구현해 설치 후 City Pass 계정 자동 연결, iOS 딥링크는 React Native Linking으로 처리."
    achievement:
      en: "When the referrer parameter kept arriving empty, ran down org-account restrictions, separate test accounts, and a direct Google inquiry, then validated real delivery by capturing incoming values via Analytics in the shipped production release."
      ko: "Referrer 파라미터가 계속 비어 오자 조직 계정 제한·별도 테스트 계정·구글 직접 문의까지 확인하고, 출시 버전에서 Analytics로 실제 수신값을 기록해 동작을 최종 검증."
    highlight:
      en: "Install Referrer integrated — validated via Analytics after exhausting Google support"
      ko: "Install Referrer 연동 — Google 문의 소진 후 Analytics로 동작 최종 확인"
    tech[4]: "React Native",TypeScript,JavaScript,Java
    image: null
    diagrams[1]:
      - "flowchart TD\n  CityPass[\"City Pass\"]\n\n  subgraph Android\n    InstallReferrer[\"Install Referrer\"]\n    InstallCondition{\"Is Installed?\"}\n    PlayStore[\"Google Play Store\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph iOS\n    Linking[\"RN Linking\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph KICKGOING\n    ReferrerLibrary[\"rn-play-install-referrer\"]\n    KLogin[\"Login\"]\n  end\n\n  CityPass -->|① Call KICKGOING| InstallReferrer\n  InstallReferrer --> InstallCondition\n  InstallCondition -->|N| PlayStore\n  InstallCondition -->|Y| ReferrerLibrary\n  PlayStore -->|install + launch| ReferrerLibrary\n  ReferrerLibrary --> KLogin\n\n  CityPass -->|DeepLink| Linking\n  Linking --> KLogin\n\n  KLogin -->|② Verify| CityPass\n  CityPass -->|③ DeepLink| KLogin"
  - id: kickgoing-route
    name: "길 안내 기능"
    nameEn: "Turn-by-Turn Navigation"
    meta: "2021.12 – 2022.04 · Mobile · TypeScript"
    tags[3]: platform:ios,platform:android,lang:ts
    desc:
      en: "In-app turn-by-turn navigation — eliminates the need to launch a separate map app. Users search a destination, see the route drawn on the map, and the map auto-zooms to fit. The only feature at KICKGOING that the developer prototyped before any planning request existed."
      ko: "앱 내 길 안내 기능 — 다른 앱을 실행해야 하는 불편함을 없앰. 목적지 검색, 지도 위 경로 표시, 자동 줌을 제공. 킥고잉에서 유일하게 기획 요청 전에 개발자가 먼저 구현한 기능."
    role:
      en: "Solo — prototyped the full flow before planning existed, then handed it to planning for the UI."
      ko: "단독 — 기획 전에 전체 흐름을 프로토타이핑한 뒤 기획자에게 전달해 UI 설계를 진행."
    work:
      en: "Defined the API spec, coordinate conversion, a Native Bridge extension, and a state-update timer for the navigation flow."
      ko: "길 안내 흐름을 위한 API 스펙 정의, 좌표 변환, Native Bridge 확장, 상태 업데이트 타이머 구현."
    achievement:
      en[3]:
        - "Reverse-engineered Daum Maps' proprietary Kongnamul coordinate system from its minified JS (the public formula was wrong) and ported the real transform to TypeScript."
        - "Extended the open-source react-native-naver-map Native Bridge to add scale calculation it lacked."
        - "Shipped to positive delivery-driver feedback, which generated multiple follow-up development requests."
      ko[3]:
        - "공개된 콩나물 좌표 변환 공식이 틀리자 다음 지도의 난독화 JS를 직접 분석해 실제 변환 함수를 찾아 TypeScript로 포팅."
        - "오픈소스 react-native-naver-map의 Native Bridge를 수정해 없던 축척 계산 기능을 추가."
        - "출시 후 대리기사들의 좋은 반응을 얻어 여러 후속 개발 문의로 이어짐."
    highlight:
      en: "Daum minified JS analyzed to extract real coordinate transform"
      ko: "다음 난독화 JS 분석으로 좌표 변환 구현"
    tech[4]: TypeScript,"React Native","Naver Map","Daum Route API"
    image: "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-route4.jpg"
    images[6]:
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-route6.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-route1.jpg"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-route2.jpg"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-route3.jpg"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-route4.jpg"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-route5.jpg"
    links[1]:
      - label: "YouTube Demo"
        href: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=MdAB0oqFh7Y"
    diagrams[1]:
      - "flowchart TD\n  User\n\n  subgraph App[\"KICKGOING App\"]\n    Search[\"Destination Search\"]\n    RouteQuery[\"Route Query\"]\n    Convert[\"Kongnamul → lat/lng\\n(reverse-engineered)\"]\n    Map[\"Naver Map\\n(+ custom scale calc)\"]\n    AutoZoom[\"Auto Zoom\"]\n  end\n\n  NaverSearch[\"Naver Search API\"]\n  DaumRoute[\"Daum Route API\\n(crawled)\"]\n\n  User -->|Tap navigate| Search\n  Search --> NaverSearch\n  NaverSearch -->|Destination| RouteQuery\n  RouteQuery --> DaumRoute\n  DaumRoute -->|Kongnamul coords| Convert\n  Convert -->|lat/lng path| Map\n  Map --> AutoZoom\n  AutoZoom --> User"
  - id: kickgoing-data-optimization
    name: "데이터 사용 최적화"
    nameEn: "Data Usage Optimization"
    meta: "2022.05 – 2022.06 · Mobile · TypeScript"
    tags[3]: platform:ios,platform:android,lang:ts
    desc:
      en: "Client-side data-usage reduction ahead of the Neighborhood Map launch — server-cached map grids, compressed coordinate payloads, and fewer redundant location calls."
      ko: "동네지도 출시를 앞둔 클라이언트 데이터 사용량 절감 — 지도 격자 서버 캐싱, 좌표 압축, 중복 위치 호출 제거."
    role:
      en: "Solo — co-designed the protocol with the server team and built the full client side."
      ko: "단독 — 서버팀과 프로토콜 공동 설계, 클라이언트 전체 구현."
    work:
      en[2]:
        - "Applied Google Polyline encoding to compress coordinate payloads."
        - "Used Flipper to trace duplicate location-fetch calls to map-move events firing on every intermediate position, and eliminated them with explicit call ordering and a guard state."
      ko[2]:
        - "Google Polyline 인코딩으로 좌표 데이터 압축."
        - "Flipper로 중복 위치 조회가 초기 이동 중 중간 위치마다 발생함을 파악하고, 호출 순서 정리·가드 상태로 제거."
    achievement:
      en: "Designed a grid-partitioned cache protocol with the server team — the map split into versioned grids, the client sending its cached grid IDs/versions and the server returning only changed grids — significantly cutting data usage."
      ko: "서버팀과 격자 캐시 프로토콜을 설계 — 지도를 버전 관리되는 격자로 분할, 클라이언트가 보유 격자 ID·버전을 보내면 서버는 변경된 격자만 응답 — 데이터 사용량을 크게 절감."
    highlight:
      en: "API data usage significantly reduced"
      ko: "API 데이터 사용량 대폭 감소"
    tech[5]: TypeScript,"React Native",AsyncStorage,"Google Polyline",Flipper
    image: null
    links[1]:
      - label: "YouTube: Background Exit Demo"
        href: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tsO0VKNlEYk"
    diagrams[1]:
      - "flowchart TD\n  LocationEvents[\"Location Events\\n(map move / init pan)\"]\n  GuardState{\"Guard State\"}\n\n  subgraph Request[\"API Request\"]\n    GridID[\"Grid ID + Cached Version\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph Server\n    VersionCheck[\"Version Check\"]\n    Polyline[\"Polyline Encoder\"]\n  end\n\n  subgraph AppCache[\"App Cache (AsyncStorage)\"]\n    CachedGrids[\"Grid Data + Version\"]\n  end\n\n  MapView[\"Map View\"]\n  Background[\"Background Entry\"]\n\n  LocationEvents -->|\"① dedup filter\"| GuardState\n  Background -->|\"stop calls\"| GuardState\n  GuardState -->|\"single deduplicated call\"| GridID\n  GridID --> VersionCheck\n  VersionCheck -->|\"② diff — changed grids only\"| Polyline\n  Polyline -->|\"③ compressed coords\"| AppCache\n  CachedGrids -.->|\"unchanged grids from cache\"| MapView\n  AppCache -->|\"new grids\"| MapView"
  - id: kickgoing-town-map
    name: "동네지도"
    nameEn: "Neighborhood Map"
    meta: "2022.07 – 2022.12 · Mobile · TypeScript"
    tags[3]: platform:ios,platform:android,lang:ts
    desc:
      en: "Place-based social map feature — brings users into the app even when not renting a scooter. Users discover and tag nearby locations using emoji markers on the Naver Map."
      ko: "장소 기반 SNS 기능 — 킥보드를 사용하지 않아도 앱에 들어오게 하는 신규 경험. Naver Map 위에 이모지 마커로 주변 장소를 발견하고 태그할 수 있음."
    role:
      en: "Solo client developer — built the feature end to end."
      ko: "클라이언트 단독 개발 — 기능 전체 구현."
    work:
      en[4]:
        - "Extended react-native-naver-map's Native Bridge view to render custom info-windows (call-out balloons)."
        - "Built a collapsible bottom panel with Reanimated + Pan Gesture as a reusable gesture-driven Animated.View."
        - "Fixed a Lottie-heavy UI perf regression (Flipper Profiler traced it to location polling while the map was off-screen) by deduplicating calls and gating updates to active-rental/visible-map states."
        - "Redesigned the API service layer into a typed service with snake_case↔camelCase conversion and injected Redux dispatch."
      ko[4]:
        - "react-native-naver-map Native Bridge View를 수정해 커스텀 말풍선(InfoWindow) 렌더링 지원."
        - "Reanimated + Pan Gesture로 재사용 가능한 접이식 하단 패널 구현."
        - "Lottie 다수 UI의 성능 저하를 Flipper Profiler로 지도 비활성 시 위치 조회 지속으로 규명, 중복 제거·대여 중/지도 활성 상태로 위치 갱신 제한."
        - "API 서비스 레이어를 타입 완비 서비스로 재설계 — snake_case↔camelCase 자동 변환, Redux dispatch 주입."
    achievement:
      en: "Built a custom emoji picker from the Unicode spec when no suitable open source existed, and published it as two npm packages: ts-unicode-emojis and react-native-emoji-collection-view."
      ko: "적합한 오픈소스가 없어 유니코드 규격을 분석해 이모지 피커를 직접 구현하고, ts-unicode-emojis·react-native-emoji-collection-view 두 npm 패키지로 배포."
    highlight:
      en: "2 npm packages published"
      ko: "npm 패키지 2개 배포"
    tech[7]: TypeScript,"React Native",Reanimated,"Pan Gesture",Lottie,Flipper,"Naver Map"
    image: null
    links[4]:
      - label: "GitHub: ts-unicode-emojis"
        href: "https://github.com/2sem/ts-unicode-emojis"
