  - id: kickgoing-channel-talk
    name: "채널톡"
    nameEn: "ChannelTalk Integration"
    meta: "2023.01 – 2023.02 · Mobile · TypeScript"
    tags[3]: platform:ios,platform:android,lang:ts
    desc:
      en: "In-app customer support that replaces the phone hotline with live chat, powered by the Channel Talk SDK."
      ko: "유선전화 고객센터를 채널톡 SDK 기반 앱 내 라이브 채팅으로 대체한 고객 지원 기능."
    role:
      en: "Solo on the client side."
      ko: "클라이언트 단독 개발."
    work:
      en: "Implemented user-info sync — on each Channel Talk session entry, push the customer's latest profile to the server so agents see current data in the dashboard."
      ko: "채널톡 진입 시 서버에 고객 최신 정보를 전송해 상담사가 대시보드에서 최신 데이터를 조회하도록 동기화 구현."
    achievement:
      en[2]:
        - "Fixed Channel Talk's broken push routing (tap opened the app but not the chat) by intercepting its notifications and re-firing them as local notifications."
        - "Root-caused a crash inside the Channel Talk SDK to a nil-to-String conversion, reported it with a fix proposal, and shipped a local patch until their update landed."
      ko[2]:
        - "채널톡 푸시가 앱만 실행하고 채팅으로 이동하지 않는 문제를, 알림을 로컬 알림으로 재발행하는 방식으로 해결."
        - "채널톡 SDK 내부 비정상 종료를 String 변환의 nil 처리 문제로 규명, 수정 제안 및 업데이트 전까지 자체 패치 적용."
    highlight:
      en: "Channel Talk push routing fixed — re-fired as local notification + SDK crash patched"
      ko: "채널톡 푸시 화면 이동 우회 해결 + SDK nil 크래시 원인 파악·패치"
    tech[3]: TypeScript,"React Native","Channel Talk SDK"
    image: "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-channeltalk1.png"
    images[4]:
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-channeltalk1.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-channeltalk2.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-channeltalk3.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-channeltalk4.png"
    links[1]:
      - label: "YouTube Demo"
        href: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=tC-np8ShcZU"
    diagrams[1]:
      - "flowchart TD\n  User\n  CTServer[\"Channel Talk Server\"]\n  Server[\"App Server\"]\n\n  subgraph App\n    Notification\n    IsChannelNoti{\"Is Channel Talk?\"}\n    Deeplink\n\n    subgraph SDK[\"Channel Talk SDK\"]\n      CTScreen[\"Channel Talk Screen\"]\n    end\n\n    FAQ[\"FAQ Screen\"]\n  end\n\n  Web[\"Channel Talk Web\"]\n  CS[\"Customer Service\"]\n\n  User --> FAQ\n  FAQ --> CTScreen\n  CTScreen --> CTServer\n  CTServer -->|Answer as Notification| User\n  User -->|Tap| Notification\n\n  Notification --> IsChannelNoti\n  IsChannelNoti -->|Y| SDK\n  IsChannelNoti -->|N| Deeplink\n\n  CTServer <--> Server\n  Server <--> Web\n  CS <--> Web"
  - id: kickgoing-notification-settings
    name: "알림 설정 분리"
    nameEn: "Notification Settings Refactor"
    meta: "2023.03 – 2023.05 · Mobile · TypeScript"
    tags[3]: platform:ios,platform:android,lang:ts
    desc:
      en: "Separated notification settings from the main Settings screen into a dedicated Notification screen — covering Android SDK 33 permission changes, iOS App Tracking Transparency, and iOS Notification Badge via Notification Extension Service."
      ko: "설정 화면의 알림 설정을 별도 알림 화면으로 분리. Android SDK 33 권한 변경 대응, iOS 앱 추적 투명성 권한 요청, iOS Notification Extension Service로 배지 동기화 구현."
    role:
      en: "All client-side work; collaborated with one server dev on the FAQ screen."
      ko: "클라이언트 전담. FAQ 화면은 서버 1인과 협업."
    work:
      en: "Branched on Android SDK 33's changed photo-permission API; fixed iOS app-tracking permission not displaying by upgrading react-native-permissions and adding the required native setup; implemented a Notification Extension Service to increment the iOS badge per push, matching Android."
      ko: "Android SDK 33 사진 권한 API 변경 분기 처리; iOS 앱 추적 권한 미표시 문제를 react-native-permissions 업그레이드·setup-ios-permission 네이티브 설정으로 해결; Notification Extension Service로 푸시 수신마다 iOS 배지 증가 구현해 Android와 동작 일치."
    achievement:
      en: "Handled platform-specific notification and permission edge cases across iOS and Android so the notification-settings split behaved consistently."
      ko: "iOS·Android의 알림·권한 플랫폼별 예외를 처리해 알림 설정 분리가 일관되게 동작하도록 구현."
    highlight:
      en: "Android SDK 33 permission split + iOS Notification Extension badge sync"
      ko: "Android SDK 33 권한 분기 + iOS Notification Extension 배지 동기화"
    tech[4]: TypeScript,"React Native","Android SDK 33","Notification Extension Service"
    links[1]:
      - label: "Medium: iOS Badge with Notification Extension"
        href: "https://medium.com/@toyboy2/setting-ios-app-badge-using-in-react-native-and-user-defaults-a4184ec6c402"
    diagrams[1]:
      - "flowchart TD\n  User\n\n  subgraph App\n    Settings[\"Settings Screen\"]\n    NotiSettingsScreen[\"Notification Settings\"]\n\n    subgraph Android\n      Badge[\"Notification Badge\"]\n      SDK33[\"Is SDK 33?\"]\n      ReadMediaPerm[\"READ_MEDIA_IMAGES\"]\n      ReadExternalPerm[\"READ_EXTERNAL_STORAGE\"]\n    end\n\n    subgraph iOS\n      Badge[\"Notification Badge\"]\n      Extension[\"Notification Extension\"]\n    end\n  end\n\n  APNS\n  FCM\n\n  FCM -->|Sync| Badge\n\n  APNS --> Extension\n  Extension --> Badge\n\n  NotiSettingsScreen --> SDK33\n  SDK33 -->|\"Y\"| ReadMediaPerm\n  SDK33 -->|\"N\"| ReadExternalPerm\n\n  User --> Settings\n  Settings --> NotiSettingsScreen"
  - id: kickgoing-eng
    name: "외국어 지원"
    nameEn: "Multilingual Support"
    meta: "2023.06 – 2023.08 · Mobile · TypeScript"
    tags[3]: platform:ios,platform:android,lang:ts
    desc:
      en: "English UI support for foreign users — detects device language and switches all strings, images, and API headers to English. Contributed app-language navigation to react-native-android-open-settings open source."
      ko: "외국인 이용자를 위한 영어 UI 지원 — 기기 언어를 감지해 문구·이미지·API 헤더를 영어로 전환. react-native-android-open-settings 오픈소스에 앱 언어 설정 화면 이동 기여."
    role:
      en: "Solo — the i18n system and an open-source contribution."
      ko: "단독 — 다국어 시스템과 오픈소스 기여."
    work:
      en[3]:
        - "Designed a per-locale string/image resource structure unified by a custom language hook that reads device locale."
        - "Added an Accept-Language header to all API requests and wired event logging for language usage."
        - "Built it incrementally — highest-impact strings first, then images, then edge cases."
      ko[3]:
        - "로케일별 문구·이미지 리소스 구조를 설계하고 기기 언어를 읽는 커스텀 언어 훅으로 통합."
        - "모든 API 요청에 Accept-Language 헤더 추가, 언어 사용 현황 이벤트 로깅 연동."
        - "영향이 큰 순서(문구→이미지→엣지케이스)로 단계적 구현."
    achievement:
      en: "Designed the team's first full RN multi-language resource pattern from scratch, and got an open-source PR merged that added Android app-language-settings navigation to react-native-android-open-settings."
      ko: "팀 내 첫 RN 다국어 리소스 패턴을 직접 설계하고, react-native-android-open-settings에 Android 앱 언어 설정 이동 기능을 추가한 오픈소스 PR을 머지."
    highlight:
      en: "Open-source PR merged"
      ko: "오픈소스 PR 머지"
    tech[5]: TypeScript,"React Native","react-native-android-open-settings","i18n","Open Source"
    image: "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-eng1.png"
    images[7]:
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-eng1.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-eng2.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-eng3.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-eng4.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-eng5.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-eng6.png"
      - "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-eng8.png"
    links[3]:
      - label: "Medium: Multi-Language in React Native"
        href: "https://medium.com/@toyboy2/supporting-multi-language-in-react-native-applications-8bf4ddc8a8ef"
      - label: "Medium: Android Per-App Language Settings"
        href: "https://medium.com/@toyboy2/react-native-android-per-app-language-settings-5f9d4a29e9d2"
      - label: "YouTube Demo"
        href: "https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=ulF32AaobeQ"
    diagrams[1]:
      - "flowchart TD\n  User\n\n\tsubgraph OS\n\t\tSettings[\"Settings App\"]\n\t\tLocalSettings[\"Locale Settings\"]\n\n\t  subgraph App\n\t    LangHook[\"useLanguage Hook\"]\n\n\t\t\tsubgraph Screen\n\t\t\t\tStringHook[\"useStrings Hook\"]\n\t\t\t\tText\n\n\t\t\t\tImageHook[\"useImages Hook\"]\n\t\t\t\tImage\n\t\t\tend\n\t  end\n  end\n\n  Server[\"App Server\"]\n\n\tUser --> Settings\n\tSettings --> |Open| LocalSettings\n\tLocalSettings --> |Choose Locale| LangHook\n\n\tLangHook --> StringHook\n\tStringHook --> Text\n\n\tLangHook --> ImageHook\n\tImageHook --> Image\n\n  Server -->|Fetch with Lang| Screen"
  - id: kickgoing-stamp
    name: "스탬프"
    nameEn: "Stamp Rewards"
    meta: "2023.09 – 2023.10 · Mobile · TypeScript"
    tags[3]: platform:ios,platform:android,lang:ts
    desc:
      en: "Stamp loyalty feature — users earn a stamp for every ride over 1 minute. Collected stamps unlock a roulette spin on return, with Lottie-powered animations for the spin, win state, and confetti celebration."
      ko: "스탬프 적립 기능 — 1분 이상 탑승 시 스탬프 지급. 수집한 스탬프로 반납 후 룰렛 화면으로 이동해 쿠폰 리워드 제공. Lottie 기반 뽑기·당첨·축하 애니메이션 포함."
    role:
      en: "Solo on the client side."
      ko: "클라이언트 단독 개발."
    work:
      en: "Built dynamic post-win stamp animations with Reanimated (stamp count drives the animation count) and fixed-state roulette/celebration animations with Lottie; coordinated with planning to route users straight to the roulette on scooter return, improving the return flow."
      ko: "당첨 후 스탬프 개수 기반 동적 애니메이션은 Reanimated로, 고정 뽑기·축하 애니메이션은 Lottie로 구현; 기획과 협의해 반납 즉시 룰렛으로 연결되도록 반납 플로우 개선."
    achievement:
      en: "Unblocked a shipping animation by proposing a free Lottie confetti alternative when the designer's file wouldn't render on iOS — letting the designer pick and avoiding an asset ping-pong loop."
      ko: "디자이너의 꽃가루 Lottie가 iOS에서 미표시되자 무료 Lottie 대안을 제안하고 디자이너가 직접 선정하게 해 에셋 핑퐁 없이 출시 블로커를 해소."
    highlight:
      en: "Stamp loyalty with Reanimated dynamic animation + Lottie confetti iOS fix"
      ko: "Reanimated 동적 애니메이션 + iOS Lottie 꽃가루 대체로 스탬프 기능 출시"
    tech[4]: TypeScript,"React Native",Lottie,Reanimated
    image: "/images/kickgoing/kickgoing-stamp1.png"
