      - "flowchart TD\n  User\n  subgraph Server[\"App Server\"]\n\t\tIsOver1m{\"Is Rent over 1m?\"}\n\t  CreateStamp[\"Create a stamp\"]\n    RouletteChance{\"Roulette Chance?\"}\n    Reward[\"Coupon Reward\"]\n  end\n\n\tsubgraph App\n\t\tRent\n\t\tEndRenting\n\t\tRouletteScreen[\"Roulette Screen\"]\n\t\tCelebration[\"Celebration Screen\"]\n\tend\n\n  User --> Rent\n  Rent --> EndRenting\n  EndRenting --> Server\n\n  IsOver1m -->|Y| CreateStamp\n  CreateStamp --> RouletteChance\n  RouletteChance -->|Roulette| Reward\n  Reward --> RouletteScreen\n  RouletteScreen --> Celebration"
